# M3 UI implementation

Map visuals to M3 tokens. Put new tokens in `app/globals.css` (`@theme` / `:root`), not as magic numbers in JSX.

## Color (`--md-sys-color-*`)

Use roles, not hex: `primary` / `on-primary` / `primary-container`, `secondary*`, `tertiary*`, `error*`, `surface`, `on-surface`, `on-surface-variant`, `surface-container[-low|high|…]`, `outline`, `outline-variant`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-[#1f2028] text-white rounded-md shadow-lg">Save</button>

// ✅ GOOD — Filled button: primary + on-primary, shape full, label-large
<button className="bg-[var(--md-sys-color-primary)] text-[var(--md-sys-color-on-primary)] rounded-[var(--md-sys-shape-corner-full)] px-6 py-2.5">
  Save
</button>
```

## Type

Font families live in `app/globals.css` (`--font-serif`, `--font-sans`, `--font-mono`). Do not change or duplicate them.

| Role | Font | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Display / Headline / Title | `var(--font-serif)` / `font-serif` | Headings, app bar, card titles |
| Body / Label | `var(--font-sans)` / `font-sans` | Paragraphs, buttons, nav, chips |
| Code | `var(--font-mono)` / `font-mono` | `code`, `pre`, kbd |

`--md-sys-typescale-*` may set size, weight, line-height, and tracking. Any `*-font` token must be `var(--font-serif)`, `var(--font-sans)`, or `var(--font-mono)`.

## Shape & elevation

- Shape scale: `none` 0, `extra-small` 4, `small` 8, `medium` 12, `large` 16, `extra-large` 28, `full`
- Cards → medium; dialogs → extra-large; buttons/chips → full
- Depth via `surface-container-*`. Shadows only when a surface sits on busy content

## Component mapping (this blog)

| UI | M3 component |
|---|---|
| Site header | [Top app bar](https://m3.material.io/components/top-app-bar/overview) |
| Post list item | [Card](https://m3.material.io/components/cards/overview) (outlined or filled) |
| Primary action | Filled button |
| Secondary action | Outlined or text button |
| Tags | Filter / assist [chips](https://m3.material.io/components/chips/overview) |
| Code block | Surface container + `font-mono`; not a Card unless it is interactive |

Do not mix Material 2 (heavy FAB-as-brand, ink ripples as identity, elevation-only shadows, 4dp “cards everywhere”).
